ent-BulkMiningRefineryLarge = industrial liquid metal refinery
    .desc = A 5×5 refinery with large reserves and four replaceable filters. A full local tank saves up to 20% of the metal; each working filter gives a separate 5% discount. Produces twice the exhaust gas. Connect armored gas pipes three tiles south of its center. Incompatible with hyper-convection upgrades.
ent-BulkMiningRefineryLargeCircuitboard = industrial liquid metal refinery board
    .desc = A circuit board for an industrial refinery. Assembly requires a 5×5 machine frame and two units of americium.
ent-DrakeRefineryFilter = Drake Industries refinery filter
    .desc = A replaceable industrial filter cartridge. Fits industrial liquid metal refineries and nebula gas siphons. Depleted cartridges must be replaced.
ent-UnfinishedMachineFrame5x5 = machine frame (5×5)
    .desc = A large machine under construction. Needs more parts.
    .suffix = Unfinished
ent-MachineFrame5x5 = machine frame (5×5)
    .desc = A wired frame for a large industrial machine.
    .suffix = Ready
ent-MachineFrameDestroyed5x5 = destroyed machine frame (5×5)
    .desc = The remains of a large industrial machine. Can be salvaged with a welding tool.
